title: Drum Key
artist: drum-agent
tempo: 80
time: 4/4
feel: Every instrument and technique, one per beat
transcriber: Reference chart for the notation key (compare with the Drum Key picture)
notes: Bar 1: china, splash, cowbell, crash. Bar 2: choked crash, ride, ride bell, closed hi-hat. Bar 3: open hi-hat, tom 1, tom 2, snare. Bar 4: ghost note, cross-stick (rim click), buzz roll, tom 3. Bar 5: floor tom, low floor tom, kick, left kick. Bar 6: hi-hat pedal, hi-hat foot splash, accent, flam.

pattern cymbals
  CH  x--- ---- ---- ----
  SP  ---- x--- ---- ----
  CB  ---- ---- x--- ----
  CR  ---- ---- ---- x---

pattern rides
  CR  k--- ---- ---- ----
  RD  ---- x--- b--- ----
  HH  ---- ---- ---- x---

pattern hats-toms
  HH  o--- ---- ---- ----
  T1  ---- x--- ---- ----
  T2  ---- ---- x--- ----
  SN  ---- ---- ---- x---

pattern snare-tech
  SN  g--- c--- z--- ----
  T3  ---- ---- ---- x---

pattern low
  FT  x--- ---- ---- ----
  F2  ---- x--- ---- ----
  BD  ---- ---- x--- ----
  B2  ---- ---- ---- x---

pattern feet
  HF  x--- o--- ---- ----
  SN  ---- ---- X--- f---

section Drum Key
  play cymbals
  play rides
  play hats-toms
  play snare-tech
  play low
  play feet
